From a22dce3e16f36c4e99f1803cc8dd4aec0802d3a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sandy Chu <sandy.chu.wiwynn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 03:03:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] configurations: yosemite5: add PowerState to MCTPI2CTarget

Add the PowerState property to CXL MCTP device configurations.

This property is used by MCTPReactor to determine whether MCTP endpoint
setup should be performed based on the current system power state.[1]

[1] https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/dbus-sensors/+/91003

Change-Id: I15511e2a6e43fbe64273d621d0c13e3856f79d37
Signed-off-by: Sandy Chu <sandy.chu.wiwynn@gmail.com>
